    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081800/extras/ad10bbbf0c6097db80d99659f63dcc38.poster.avif?t=1751309262\" width=460 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081800/extras/ad10bbbf0c6097db80d99659f63dcc38.webm?t=1751309262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081800/extras/ad10bbbf0c6097db80d99659f63dcc38.mp4?t=1751309262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Delivery: Nightmare Courier</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person psychological horror experience about the darkest deliveries you\u2019ll ever make.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a night delivery driver. A simple gig, odd addresses, vague shadows outside your window. But with every new package, reality begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone</strong> is watching you.<br><strong>Something</strong> hides inside the cargo.<br><strong>Somewhere</strong> on the map lies a place you must never go\u2026 but you have no choice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Authentic Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Like <i>Fear to Fathom</i>, the terror builds through sounds, shadows, and your own creeping dread.<br>\u2705 <strong>Nighttime Routes</strong> \u2013 Each delivery pulls you deeper into the nightmare.<br>\u2705 <strong>Mysterious Clients</strong> \u2013 What are the recipients hiding? Why do they stare at you so\u2026 hungrily?<br>\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Horror</strong> \u2013 Random encounters, scripted chases, and multiple endings.<br>\u2705 <strong>Survival Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Limited gas, a dying flashlight, and the choice: run or deliver the package at any cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The Last Delivery isn\u2019t just a job. It\u2019s your final run.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081800/extras/ad10bbbf0c6097db80d99659f63dcc38.poster.avif?t=1751309262\" width=460 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081800/extras/ad10bbbf0c6097db80d99659f63dcc38.webm?t=1751309262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081800/extras/ad10bbbf0c6097db80d99659f63dcc38.mp4?t=1751309262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Delivery: Nightmare Courier</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person psychological horror experience about the darkest deliveries you\u2019ll ever make.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a night delivery driver. A simple gig, odd addresses, vague shadows outside your window. But with every new package, reality begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone</strong> is watching you.<br><strong>Something</strong> hides inside the cargo.<br><strong>Somewhere</strong> on the map lies a place you must never go\u2026 but you have no choice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Authentic Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Like <i>Fear to Fathom</i>, the terror builds through sounds, shadows, and your own creeping dread.<br>\u2705 <strong>Nighttime Routes</strong> \u2013 Each delivery pulls you deeper into the nightmare.<br>\u2705 <strong>Mysterious Clients</strong> \u2013 What are the recipients hiding? Why do they stare at you so\u2026 hungrily?<br>\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Horror</strong> \u2013 Random encounters, scripted chases, and multiple endings.<br>\u2705 <strong>Survival Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Limited gas, a dying flashlight, and the choice: run or deliver the package at any cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The Last Delivery isn\u2019t just a job. It\u2019s your final run.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You're a night shift courier. Your job is to deliver packages before dawn. But the further you go, the clearer it becomes\u2014the clients aren\u2019t waiting for the cargo\u2026 They\u2019re waiting for you. Will you survive your final shift?",
